{
  "_": [
    "rush_le on drhotwing's 'Rush LE Tribute' 2.0.2 (VPUniverse 32514), a scripted",
    "tribute: vpxshadow.py keeps its script as a shadow game and hands the ball to",
    "the real game. This build of rush_le ships NO device positions, so every",
    "lane below is placed from the table's object coordinates against Stern's",
    "switch NAMES; the ones marked GUESS want a check against the game's display.",
    "Numbers: switch 1000+id (switch_list.txt), solenoids the small numbers under",
    "`solenoids` (core.vbs's SolCallback(68)); flippers keep core.vbs's 46/48/34.",
    "The ids are the RIG's switch_list.txt for rush_le-1_19_0 (the shim's own",
    "reading): an older table of this title numbered every switch one higher and",
    "pressed Tournament Start for Start."
  ],
